tasks.description:
创建 Note 模型用于存储笔记数据。在 app/models/ 目录下创建 note.py 文件，定义 Note 类，包含字段: id (int, 主键), title (str, 笔记标题), content (str, 笔记内容), created_at (datetime, 创建时间), updated_at (datetime, 更新时间)。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

创建数据库迁移文件以初始化笔记表。在 migrations/ 目录下创建迁移脚本，生成 notes 表，包含字段: id, title, content, created_at, updated_at。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

创建笔记的 CRUD API 路由。在 app/routes/ 目录下创建 notes.py 文件，定义增删改查接口，使用 Note 模型与数据库交互。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

创建笔记管理的前端页面。在 templates/ 目录下创建 notes.html 文件，包含以下功能: 显示笔记列表、创建新笔记的表单、编辑和删除笔记的按钮。使用 JavaScript 调用后端 API。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

在后端实现搜索功能，支持通过标题或内容关键字搜索笔记。在 app/routes/notes.py 中添加搜索接口，并在前端 notes.html 页面中添加搜索输入框和结果展示区域。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}
- GET /notes/search (request: {query: str}) -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
